1972
01:11:39,528 --> 01:11:40,496
THE ORIGINAL SMUG GUY

1973
01:11:41,297 --> 01:11:42,498
It must've been you.

1974
01:11:42,564 --> 01:11:44,033
Yes, it was me.

1975
01:11:44,099 --> 01:11:46,035
THE SMUG CHOIMPION OF THE SHOW!

1976
01:11:46,101 --> 01:11:48,604
Sung-jun only picks up on those things.

1977
01:11:48,671 --> 01:11:50,105
The mischievous things.

1978
01:11:50,172 --> 01:11:52,975
-Stick it on now.
-It goes into the oven.

1979
01:11:53,042 --> 01:11:56,145
It went in
with only 5 minutes and 20 seconds left.

1980
01:11:56,912 --> 01:12:01,750
COOK LIKE A CHEF
LESSON 5: KNIFE TIP STAYS ON THE BOARD!

1981
01:12:01,817 --> 01:12:02,985
Five minutes and thirty seconds.

1982
01:12:03,319 --> 01:12:05,487
CHIVES

1983
01:12:06,488 --> 01:12:08,357
Sung-jun gets the pasta out.

1984
01:12:08,424 --> 01:12:09,692
Huh?

1985
01:12:09,758 --> 01:12:11,894
Don't you think the pasta is too thin?

1986
01:12:12,728 --> 01:12:14,730
